# Room Assignment Endpoints Test
# Run these requests to verify the endpoints work correctly

### 1. Create Room Assignment (POST /api/v1.0/Guests/{guestId}/room-assignments)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1.0/Guests/1/room-assignments
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "guestId": 1,
  "hotelId": 1,
  "roomNumber": "101",
  "startDate": "2024-01-15T14:00:00Z",
  "endDate": "2024-01-20T11:00:00Z",
  "notes": "Test room assignment"
}

### 2. Get Guest Room Assignments (GET /api/v1.0/Guests/{guestId}/room-assignments)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1.0/Guests/1/room-assignments
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 3. Get Current Room Assignment (GET /api/v1.0/Guests/{guestId}/current-room)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1.0/Guests/1/current-room
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Manual Test Instructions:
1. First login to get a JWT token:
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1.0/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "ahmet@guestflow.com",
  "password": "Admin123!"
}

2. Copy the accessToken from the response and set it as {{token}}

3. Run the requests above in order

4. Expected responses:
- POST should return 201 Created with room assignment data
- GET room-assignments should return 200 OK with array of assignments
- GET current-room should return 200 OK with current assignment or 404 if none
